      "help_zh": "本次访问的起始位置",
      "location": "formData",
      "name": "offset",
      "options": [
        "--offset"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Offset",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "example": "30",
      "help_en": "The maximum number of clusters to return",
      "help_zh": "集群列表最大数量",
      "location": "formData",
      "name": "limit",
      "options": [
        "--limit"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Limit",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    }
  ],
  "pathPattern": "",
  "product_code": "servicemesh",
  "protocol": "HTTP|HTTPS",
  "responses": {
    "200": {
      "schema": {
        "properties": {
          "Clusters": {
            "backendName": "clusters",
            "description_en": "A list of clusters",
            "description_zh": "集群列表信息",
            "itemName": "Cluster",
            "items": {
              "properties": {
                "ClusterDomain": {
                  "backendName": "cluster_domain",
                  "description_en": "The domain name of the cluster",
                  "description_zh": "集群域名",
                  "example": "c.com",
                  "type": "string",
                  "visibility": "Public"
                },
                "ClusterId": {
                  "backendName": "cluster_id",
                  "description_en": "The cluster ID",
                  "description_zh": "集群ID",
                  "example": "c80f45444b3da447da60a911390c2****",
                  "type": "string",
                  "visibility": "Public"
                },
                "ClusterType": {
                  "backendName": "cluster_type",
                  "description_en": "The type of the cluster",
                  "description_zh": "集群类型",
                  "example": "Ask",
                  "type": "string",
                  "visibility": "Public"
                },
                "CreationTime": {
                  "backendName": "created",
                  "description_en": "The time when the cluster was created",
                  "description_zh": "集群创建时间",
                  "example": "2020-05-12T15:38:16+08:00",
                  "type": "string",
                  "visibility": "Public"
                },
                "ErrorMessage": {
                  "backendName": "errMsg",
                  "description_en": "The error message returned if the cluster is in an abnormal state",
                  "description_zh": "集群的异常信息",
                  "example": "fail",
                  "type": "string",
                  "visibility": "Public"
                },
                "ForbiddenFlag": {
                  "backendName": "forbidden_flag",
                  "description_en": "The reason why the data plane cluster cannot be added to the ASM instance. Valid values:\n\n`0`: The cluster is normal and can be added.\n\n`1`: You do not have the administrative permissions on the cluster.\n\n`2`: The cluster and the service mesh are in different VPCs, and no Cloud Enterprise Network (CEN) instance is used to connect them.\n\n`3`: The CIDR block of the cluster conflicts with that of the service mesh.\n\n`4`: The cluster has a namespace named istio-system",
                  "description_zh": "数据面集群不能加入ASM的原因，取值：\n\n`0`：表示正常，可加入。\n\n`1`：表示您没有集群的adminlevel权限。\n\n`2`：集群和网格位于不同的VPC中，并且它们之间没有CEN。\n\n`3`：集群的CIDR与网格冲突。\n\n`4`：集群已具有名为istio-system的命名空间",
                  "example": "0",
                  "format": "int64",
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                "ForbiddenInfo": {
                  "backendName": "forbidden_info",
                  "description_en": "The detailed reason why the data plane cluster cannot be added to the ASM instance. The value is a JSON string in the following format:\n\n```\n[\n  {\n    \"cluster\": \"cdd55bd6e054b4c6ca18ec02614******\",\n    \"object\": \"Pod\",\n    \"cidr\": \"172.16.0.0/24\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"cluster\": \"cfa37fdf7cb1641e1976f8293ac******\",\n    \"object\": \"Pod\",\n    \"cidr\": \"172.16.0.0/24\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\nThe preceding example indicates that the pod CIDR block `172.16.0.0/24` of the cluster `cdd55bd6e054b4c6ca18ec02614******` conflicts with the pod CIDR block `172.16.0.0/24` of the cluster `cfa37fdf7cb1641e1976f8293ac******`.\n\nValid values of `object`:\n\n`Pod`\n\n`Service`\n\n`VSwitch`\n\n`VPC`\n\n`VPC CIDR`",
                  "description_zh": "数据面集群不能加入ASM的详细原因，格式为JSON字符串，格式为：\n```\n[\n  {\n    \"cluster\": \"cdd55bd6e054b4c6ca18ec02614******\",\n    \"object\": \"Pod\",\n    \"cidr\": \"172.16.0.0/24\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"cluster\": \"cfa37fdf7cb1641e1976f8293ac******\",\n    \"object\": \"Pod\",\n    \"cidr\": \"172.16.0.0/24\"\n  }\n]\n```\n以上例子中表示集群`cdd55bd6e054b4c6ca18ec02614******`的Pod CIDR `172.16.0.0/24`与集群`cfa37fdf7cb1641e1976f8293ac******`的Pod CIDR `172.16.0.0/24`发生了冲突。\n\n`object`取值：\n`Pod`\n`Service`\n`VSwitch`\n`VPC`\n`VPC CIDR`",
                  "example": "[{\"cluster\":\"cdd55bd6e054b4c6ca18ec02614******\", \"object\":\"Pod\", \"cidr\":\"172.16.0.0/24\"},{\"cluster\":\"cfa37fdf7cb1641e1976f8293ac******\", \"object\":\"Pod\", \"cidr\":\"172.16.0.0/24\"}]",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "Name": {
                  "backendName": "name",
                  "description_en": "The name of the cluster",
                  "description_zh": "集群名称",
                  "example": "ask1",
                  "type": "string",
                  "visibility": "Public"
                },
                "RegionId": {
                  "backendName": "region_id",
                  "description_en": "The ID of the region where the cluster resides",
                  "description_zh": "集群所在地域ID",
                  "example": "cn-hangzhou",
                  "type": "string",
                  "visibility": "Public"
                },
                "ServiceMeshId": {
                  "backendName": "service_mesh_id",
                  "description_en": "The service mesh ID",
                  "description_zh": "服务网格ID",
                  "example": "cb8963379255149cb98c8686f274x****",
                  "type": "string",
                  "visibility": "Public"
                },
                "SgId": {
                  "backendName": "security_group_id",
                  "description_en": "The security group ID",
                  "description_zh": "安全组ID",
                  "example": "sg-bp197668l6iupljy****",
                  "type": "string",
                  "visibility": "Public"
                },
                "State": {
                  "backendName": "state",
                  "description_en": "The status of the cluster. Valid values:\n\n`running`: The cluster is running.\n\n`starting `: The cluster is being started.\n\n`stopping `: The cluster is being stopped.\n\n`stopped`: The cluster is stopped.\n\n`failed`: The cluster is in the failed state",
                  "description_zh": "集群状态，取值：\n\n`running`：运行中。\n\n`starting `：启动中。\n\n`stopping `：终止中。\n\n`stopped`：已停止。\n\n`failed`：失败",
                  "example": "running",
                  "type": "string",
                  "visibility": "Public"
                },
                "UpdateTime": {
                  "backendName": "updated",
                  "description_en": "The time when the cluster was last modified",
                  "description_zh": "集群最后修改时间",
                  "example": "2020-05-12T15:38:16+08:00",
                  "type": "string",
                  "visibility": "Public"
                },
                "Version": {
                  "backendName": "current_version",
                  "description_en": "The version number of the cluster",
                  "description_zh": "集群版本号",
                  "example": "v1.16.6-aliyun.1",
                  "type": "string",
                  "visibility": "Public"
                },
                "VpcId": {
                  "backendName": "vpc_id",
                  "description_en": "The virtual private cloud (VPC) ID",
                  "description_zh": "专有网络ID",
                  "example": "vpc-8vbrwmt95b4zf6wf7****",
                  "type": "string",
                  "visibility": "Public"
                }
              },
              "type": "object"
            },
            "nullToEmpty": true,
            "type": "array",
            "visibility": "Public"
          },
          "NumberOfClusters": {
            "backendName": "numberOfClusters",
            "description_en": "The total number of container service clusters in the current region",
            "description_zh": "当前Region下的容器服务集群总数",
            "example": "5",
            "format": "int64",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "RequestId": {
            "backendName": "requestId",
            "description_en": "The request ID",
            "description_zh": "请求ID",
            "example": "31d3a0f0-07ed-4f6e-9004-1804498c****",
            "type": "string",
            "visibility": "Public"
          }
        },
        "type": "object"
      }
    }
  }
}
